UR5e MoveIt simulation configuration

The chain and disabled collision pairs in config/ur5e.srdf are adapted from:
UniversalRobots/Universal_Robots_ROS2_Driver (humble), ur_moveit_config,
srdf/ur_macro.srdf.xacro, licensed under Apache-2.0.
https://github.com/UniversalRobots/Universal_Robots_ROS2_Driver/blob/humble/ur_moveit_config/srdf/ur_macro.srdf.xacro

The robot geometry, inertias, nominal kinematics and joint limits are loaded
from UniversalRobots/Universal_Robots_ROS2_Description (ur_description,
BSD-3-Clause). Those upstream assets are downloaded separately and are not
redistributed in this repository.
